{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 58, "text": "// Quest 2 (Have we seen each other yet?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 59, "text": "!ﻮﻟﻮﭼﻮﮐ ﻖﻤﺣﺍ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location9", "line_index": 60, "text": "،ﯼﺍ ﻩﺰﻣﺎﺑ ﯽﯾﺍﺭﻮﺟ ﻪﯾ ،ﯽﻧﻭﺪﯿﻣ"}
